      "slide": 3,
      "slot_id": "subtitle"
    },
    {
      "canonical_value": "Redundant sensing reduces single-point blind spots but does not remove calibration drift risk.",
      "content_hash": "af3d7425df48a62aa08a3509bcb564f287e66f07f89e7f876445e8fc7311e45e",
      "item_id": "slide-03-risk-findings-evidence-01",
      "kind": "text",
      "pass": true,
      "selector": "#slide-3 > div:nth-of-type(17)",
      "slide": 3,
      "slot_id": "body"
    },
    {
      "canonical_value": "A loss of reliable flow telemetry can hide a developing restriction until component temperatures begin to rise.",
      "content_hash": "4e8588692f5ae7dbb10f93b191be6fc70fe0140a628f730eddbb6fd5fda4216b",
      "item_id": "slide-03-risk-findings-evidence-02",
      "kind": "text",
      "pass": true,
      "selector": "#slide-3 > div:nth-of-type(22)",
      "slide": 3,
      "slot_id": "body"
    },
    {
      "canonical_value": "Shared heat-rejection saturation can affect multiple compute rows at the same time.",
      "content_hash": "a6cc92e789bbe44946926fc0d5c99e2d5efd117def44ecae055ebcb23a7d8e84",
      "item_id": "slide-03-risk-findings-evidence-03",
      "kind": "text",
      "pass": true,
      "selector": "#slide-3 > div:nth-of-type(27)",
      "slide": 3,
      "slot_id": "body"
    },
    {
      "canonical_value": "A combined option can address both rapid flow loss and slower sensor degradation without requiring a full plant redesign.",
      "content_hash": "c69f036d3782421dc697a3da93cfb538edbe127221ddd569360c6435c35400aa",
      "item_id": "slide-03-risk-findings-evidence-04",
      "kind": "text",
      "pass": true,
      "selector": "#slide-3 > div:nth-of-type(32)",
      "slide": 3,
      "slot_id": "body"
    },
    {
      "canonical_value": "Facility heat-rejection capacity remains a shared upstream constraint even when the primary loop is healthy.",
      "content_hash": "641b2c8c60036cd2f3be82b9cf7f53ae21d4bd435e44c411584e76b43be287db",
      "item_id": "slide-03-risk-findings-evidence-05",
